WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Six figures sit round a lamp.

2
00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.720
Five men, and one woman.

3
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.310
In front of them appear a
doctor's bag, a typescript,

4
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:14.530
a timetable, a crucifix, a rifle,
garlic flowers and a syringe.

5
00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.980
Across the table, one tall shadow waits.

6
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.140
Alone.

7
00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.950
Five men against a single vampire.

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.510
So why do the heroes need so many?

9
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.180
In this mission, you'll meet the band, from
a professor from Amsterdam to an American

10
00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.510
from Texas.

11
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.320
You'll see them take
hands in a solemn compact,

12
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:37.260
and find out what Van Helsing
sets against the vampire's power.

13
00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:40.150
And you'll hear how he
frames the chase east:

14
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.650
"as the old knights of the Cross".

15
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.440
Your mission: work out why
the heroes need so many.
